<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng Bank launches HK$1.2 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng Bank launches HK$1.2 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger and bookrunner HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DAO HENG BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     HK$1.2 BLN   COUPON     3MH+36    MATURITY 17.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH   07.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	   CALLS	NONE	REPLIES  28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	   REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING     A3*	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV **</p>
<p>NEG</p>
<p>PLG NO CRS DEF NO FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  HONG KONG    GOV LAW    HONG KONG</p>
<p> PAY DATE   17.DEC.96 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS    HK$100 MLN+    22.5BP   ALL-IN  43.5</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MGRS    HK$70-99 MLN   18.0BP   ALL-IN  42.0</p>
<p>   SENIOR MGRS     HK$40-69 MLN   15.0BP   ALL-IN  41.0</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  CHINA DEVELOPMENT FINANCE CO (BOOKS), COMMERZ (EAST</p>
<p>		ASIA), HANG SENG BANK, HSBC MARKETS (BOOKS), SAKURA</p>
<p>		FINANCE ASIA AND UNITED OVERSEAS BANK.</p>
<p> PAYING AGENT   HONG KONG BANK</p>
<p> NOTES   PARI PASSU, UNSUBORDINATED DEBT</p>
<p>	   *ISSUER RATING. ISSUE RATING TO BE ADVISED.</p>
<p>	   **TAX PROVISIONS--GROSS UP, TAX CALL.</p>
</text>
